{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_title", "source_sha256": "802b1b388c7b69c6a45bbaee77137cabeb1d60e03a2868c2969b4f8bb21f9830", "ja": "Re:FLAME #3 留守電", "zh": "Re:FLAME #3 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d19bff5e532159dbcaa3d89ceb2c376d1a1fd958127e4f006f6efda6253f7e56", "ja": "京都での公演を無事に終えた\n響からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是响在京都的公演顺利结束后留下的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "09dc1b70188b965c65019f2174eea1277d05a9db7a0810a6faba7feb0c46e149", "ja": "はいさーい！　{$P$}、響だぞっ。\n今日のライブ、見ててくれた？", "zh": "你好呀——！{$P$}，我是响哦！今天的演出，你有看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "c728d443e6bd855d66b30c78a16871c1189c0790594cfe4ec3a8b4ad2681b040", "ja": "美希と貴音と一緒に、\n全公演、全力で走り切ったさー！", "zh": "和美希、贵音一起，拼尽全力跑完了所有公演啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "6a540520a4b5f8dc84c259ef8dd5620bdc11011ba80f2e7032e6174ac1f1fa97", "ja": "自分、今回はライブが決まった時から、\nずーっとワクワクしてたんだ！", "zh": "这次从确定要办演唱会开始，我就一直兴奋得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "9eddab6fd2893abbfadc320448ba7f23d7bec969b988c08a8384284ae0bc93ea", "ja": "だって美希も貴音もすごいでしょ？\n歌もダンスも、パフォーマンス全部が！", "zh": "因为美希和贵音都很厉害嘛！\n无论是歌唱、舞蹈，还是整体表现，都很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "05c9939d53558b002bee0e291c823ccec9f7710f01ce0a9a0edea4b81f5e8a87", "ja": "そういうライバルと一緒のステージって、\nすっごく燃えるからね！", "zh": "和这样的对手一起站上舞台，真的特别燃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d816840d879c833d599cc0b7b3ee2aec61773a53888c6d48b3df5a6ab285878", "ja": "絶対に負けないよう、自分はレッスンから\nずっと全力で、いつもの2倍頑張ったんだぞ！", "zh": "为了绝对不输，我从训练开始就一直全力以赴，比平时努力了2倍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "db1eb00386ffd1a16966acac314983c0b65b75efc707892271e535aae6c582be", "ja": "だから今回のライブは、いつもの2倍\nカンペキだったはずさー。あっははは！", "zh": "所以这次的演出，应该比平时完美2倍才对啦——啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "055b610b3b5166963d1694d9326014162cc121d44e6e91141f3c46fe28e10d3b", "ja": "あ、そうそう。今回はすっごく自信があったから、ウチ\nの家族たちみんなにも、楽屋で聞いててもらったんだ。", "zh": "啊，对了对了。这次我特别有自信，所以还让家里的大家\n全都在后台听了听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "9f819b39339b63e82599f9dc8cc0f1bfd6db727a234b8b0b90b31fad49b486ed", "ja": "今も一緒にいるんだぞ。みんな、すごく良かったって！\nね、{$P$}もそう思うよね！", "zh": "现在大家也都和我在一起哦。他们都说特别棒！\n对吧，{$P$}也这么觉得吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "1acd2d3955fa7fabef93556ae3369f390575d1cb1a06261a715bf0d82822b2f2", "ja": "え？　あ、ごめんちょっと待って、貴音が呼んでる。\n……どうしたんだ、貴音？", "zh": "诶？啊，抱歉，等一下，贵音在叫我。\n……怎么了，贵音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "7222430350f93572f737b9be32c4ae3dd4744fd7eebca932ae3a714cb794d667", "ja": "えええええっ！！", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "5eea69ee92d296e7350120f4fc43ac6c54a9cba9a6c446822ba39d1394c90792", "ja": "大変、オウ助が逃げちゃったって！\n自分、ちょっと探してくる！", "zh": "大事不好了，据说王助逃跑了！\n我先去找找看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "c530ade14f70e841279474516f9e4922d33e70fdcd1ac93f14755a6826938269", "ja": "ライブの感想は、後で劇場でいっぱい聞かせてよね！\nそれじゃ！", "zh": "演出的感想，之后在剧场里要多跟我说说哦！\n那就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_04_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "9628a6e565214aef60cb1b13741bd3f15b660d2dd5d0b54eced48c534a07d0d8", "ja": "オウ助、どこ行ったんだ～！　出てきてよ～！\nお昼に君のキャベツを食べたことなら謝るから～！", "zh": "欧助，你跑哪儿去了～！快出来嘛～！\n要是因为我中午吃了你的卷心菜，我道歉就是了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
